          "name": "index.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <title>Homepage</title>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <header>\n    <h1>Welcome to My Website</h1>\n    <nav>\n      <a href=\"index.html\">Home</a> |\n      <a href=\"contact.html\">Contact</a>\n    </nav>\n  </header>\n\n  <main>\n    <section>\n      <h2>About Us</h2>\n      <p>We are a small team dedicated to building simple, elegant web experiences using modern web technologies.</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section>\n      <h2>Our Services</h2>\n      <ul>\n        <li>Web Design</li>\n        <li>Web Development</li>\n        <li>Consulting</li>\n      </ul>\n    </section>\n\n    <section>\n      <h2>Latest News</h2>\n      <p>Check out our latest updates and projects on our blog. We regularly post about technology and design trends.</p>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <footer>\n    <p>&copy; 2025 My Website. All rights reserved.</p>\n  </footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n  ",
