    "long_instructions": "## Do This:\r\n\r\nUse AI to generate and refine a stylesheet that applies your brand’s colors and fonts.\r\n\r\n1. Attach `prompt.md` as context.\r\n2. Ask AI to style the page based on your plan.\r\n3. Preview your page.\r\n   - Does it match your brand?\r\n   - Is the text easy to read?\r\n   - Do all sections feel consistent?\r\n\r\n5. Iterate with the AI to improve specific parts if needed.",
